ve the Throne. You have not besides Him any protector or any intercessor; so will you not be reminded?","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"32:5","t":"He arranges [each] matter from the heaven to the earth; then it will ascend to Him in a Day, the extent of which is a thousand years of those which you count.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"32:6","t":"That is the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"32:7","t":"Who perfected everything which He created and began the creation of man from clay.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"32:8","t":"Then He made his posterity out of the extract of a liquid disdained.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"32:9","t":"Then He proportioned him and breathed into him from His [created] soul and made for you hearing and vision and hearts [i.e., intellect]; little are you grateful.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"32:10","t":"And they say, \"When we are lost [i.e., disintegrated] within the earth, will we indeed be [recreated] in a new creation?\" Rather, they are, in the meeting with their Lord, disbelievers.","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"32:11","t":"Say, \"The angel of death who has been entrusted with you will take you. Then to your Lord you will be returned.\"","j":21,"h":42,"s":32,"a":11,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[32],"sajdah":false}